{"abstract":"The so-called “death valley curve” represents a crucial early phase of new ventures, when substantial work on a new enterprise has begun but no sufficient revenue has been generated. During this period, companies deplete their initial capital in their quest to establish the business. To help navigate this tricky time, the authors have created a matrix with four phases of new entrepreneurial ventures and the strategic challenges in each phase.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Pedersen, Carsten Lund"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-283843"],"filters":{"added":"2022-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an entrepreneur s guide to surviving the death valley curve","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://hbr.org/2022/04/an-entrepreneurs-guide-to-surviving-the-death-valley-curve","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-283843","ids":["cbs-5871a21c-0c57-4c80-b956-2340d82dc0a6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9939FE0627FD7A20013D4B1B6BCACBC6"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Lund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Carsten Lund","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01000000"],"journal":"Harvard Business Review Digital Articles","publisher":"Harvard Business School Press","status":"p","title":"Harvard Business Review Digital Articles"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-5871a21c-0c57-4c80-b956-2340d82dc0a6"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"An Entrepreneur's Guide to Surviving the \"Death Valley Curve\"","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-283843","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"This booklet builds upon and extends our previous work on business strategy, which we published in April 2020 in the Harvard Business Review (HBR.org). While the general ideas remain the same, certain aspects have changed from the original article. For instance, we have realized that strategic decisions regarding “position” are best served by explicitly considering three subdimensions, namely purpose, place, and performance. Likewise, in this booklet, we have reduced our focus on crisis management – the predominant context of our original article. Instead, we aim to provide a general guide for strategy development – applicable regardless of the situation at hand. HOW TO USE THE STRATEGY POSTER With this booklet, we wish to provide a short but comprehensive guide to defining, discussing, and developing an organization’s strategy – which can be placed on a strategy poster. The dictionary definition of “poster” is as follows: 1: a usually large, printed sheet that often contains pictures and is posted in a public place (as to promote something) 2: a person who posts something online Both aspects are relevant for our work. We believe that the outcome of strategic discussions should be clear enough to be placed on a poster for promoting the strategy – and that strategists should increasingly act as ‘posters’, i.e., communicators of the newly developed strategy. We hope that this booklet and the application of our Strategy Poster help improve strategy discussions, strategy alignment, and strategy implementation. The booklet is a part of the research activities underlying the servitize.dk (https://servitize.dk/) project supported by the Danish Industry Foundation.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Pedersen, Carsten Lund","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S02-083.33-032187"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what is your strategy how to put your strategic thinking onto a single strategy poster","src":["cbs","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/71768604/carsten_lund_pedersen_et_al_what_is_your_strategy_2022_booklet.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-083.33-032187","ids":["cbs-e8973b43-0a6c-442f-b3d7-9ec282a2991e","itu-0d73963d-3a18-45e3-851b-297787b13d3a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-6FF040E91FEC1CDF156EFF5C2FE37ACA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/71768604/carsten_lund_pedersen_et_al_what_is_your_strategy_2022_booklet.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"rem","url":"https://research.cbs.dk/da/publications/what-is-your-strategy-how-to-put-your-strategic-thinking-onto-a-s","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"aff