{"abstract":"WHO IS THIS BOOKLET FOR? This booklet is written for decision-makers in manufacturing firms who want to analyze the status of their organizations’ product, service, and data integration strategies and initiatives. The booklet offers tools useful for reflecting on and analyzing this issue. As such, it provides executives with an opportunity to understand their current P+S+D integration situation. The booklet is a part of the research activities underlying the servitize.dk (https://servitize.dk/) project supported by the Danish Industry Foundation.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Frandsen, Thomas","Hsuan, Juliana","Pedersen, Carsten Lund","Raja, Jawwad","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S02-087.50-032049"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"product service data integration how integrated are products services and data in your business","src":["cbs","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/71783060/thomas_frandsen_et_al_product_service_data_integration_how_integrated_are_products_services_and_data_in_your_business_2022_booklet.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-087.50-032049","ids":["cbs-cad957c7-d0d1-4791-806e-fe276ec2c7d5","itu-c34776e7-9a99-43ff-b3a2-e7d913c7d717"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-7DB496EA70E8380A81337248D91CAAC3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/71783060/thomas_frandsen_et_al_product_service_data_integration_how_integrated_are_products_services_and_data_in_your_business_2022_booklet.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"rem","url":"https://research.cbs.dk/da/publications/product-service-data-integration-how-integrated-are-products-serv","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Operations Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"frandsenpau","last":"Frandsen","locid":"2736fa7c-b41b-4aaa-a5a8-ca3f8eac7228","name":"Frandsen, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-9487-5339","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Juliana","key":"hsuanpau","last":"Hsuan","locid":"0dae4c69-7c46-47aa-9457-d94c36853dda","name":"Hsuan, Juliana","orcid":"0000-0003-3084-6288","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Lund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"5f3b7745-99be-4d1b-8ce1-a413325c2008","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","name_org":"Pedersen, Carsten Lund","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jawwad","key":"rajapau","last":"Raja","locid":"16b2e508-40a4-4caf-8760-54e31644b963","name":"Raja, Jawwad","orcid":"0000-0001-8123-5781","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":