{"abstract":"Digital transformation transcends technology and business models. Organizational culture also plays a critical role in successfully leading an organization into the digital era; indeed, the success of a digital transformation relies on a deep understanding of the intricacies of culture. But few business leaders fully understand how a company’s culture changes during a digital transformation — and, more importantly, how it doesn’t change.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383003"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Change management","Digital transformation","Organizational change","Organizational culture"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cracking the culture code for successful digital transformation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://sloanreview.mit.edu/article/cracking-the-culture-code-for-successful-digital-transformation/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383003","ids":["itu-75bce918-ce10-4fe5-afb3-cee710122fab"],"keyword":["Digital Transformation","Organizational change","Organizational culture","change management"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D7170F81ADB3FE7740727D1A4F022D41"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"fir