{"abstract":"Empathy, that is, the capacity of understanding another person's perspective and feelings, has conventionally been a pillar of marketing, as the discipline from its very inception has emphasized the importance of understanding and putting oneself in the shoes of customers. Yet, with an increasing focus on rationality, objectivity, and science, marketing has arguably become more empathy‐deprived. This is unfortunate, as the increasing objectification, specialization, and the resultant distancing and fragmentation of the marketing field make it proportionally essential to emphasize an empathetic approach to marketing. Here, I address this gap by (re)introducing an empathetic approach to marketing entitled empathy‐based marketing. Empathy‐based marketing addresses the increasing customer‐distancing and subdivision of the field of marketing, by focusing on an empathetic core, stimulating cross‐fertilization, and accentuating the general well‐being of the field. Beyond discussing what this paradigm is and why the field needs it, an agenda for future research is also outlined.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-285992"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Art","Dominant logics","Humanized technology","Paradigms","Science"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"empathy based marketing","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-285992","identifier":[{"id":"85099071239","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-6ed4158b-9a58-444b-9bdf-f170c016c8ff"],"keyword":["Art","Dominant logics","Humanized technology","Paradigms","Science"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9F384D2B6F58D0D6D9E4B041D3E812B0"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Marketing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/mar.21448","issn":["07426046","15206793"],"issn_org":["07426046"],"issue":"3","journal":"Psychology & Marketing","pages":"470-480","publisher":"Wiley-Liss Inc.","status":"p","title":"Psychology & Marketing","volume":"38"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85099071239"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-6ed4158b-9a58-444b-9bdf-f170c016c8ff"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Empathy‐based Marketing","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-285992","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Empowerment, self-organisation og self-management er nogle af de ord, der ofte knyttes til agile transformationer og forandringer. I afsnit 32 af Den Agile Podcast har vores vært, Stefan Lenskjold Grønbek, besøg af Carsten Lund Pedersen, PhD i “Medarbejderautonomi” og Adjunkt ved CBS. Sammen udfolder de begrebet “Medarbejderautonomi” og relaterer det til Agile. For både ledere og medarbejdere er det helt central at forstå hvad der menes med ord som empowerment, self-organisation og self-management. Hvad betyder de? Hvad kan vi selv træffe beslutninger om og hvilke nye forventninger og krav følger med, samt hvilke nye kompetencer kræver det at udfylde denne autonomi? Som Scrum Master eller Agil Coach, er dette ofte et rum der er en vis uklarhed omkring og med afsnittet her, vil du måske få nogle nye perspektiver og muligheder for at identificere og italesætte denne uklarhed.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-291240"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"den agile podcast afsnit 000000000032 medarbejderautonomi","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ugilic.dk/2021/12/podcast-32-medarbejderautonomi/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-291240","ids":["cbs-a69f703b-1dd9-4db2-ba4c-ff8ab54148d0"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-8CA5732CA66D7C3A15F9D0068CBAF3E1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ugilic.dk/2021/12/podcast-32-medarbejderautonomi/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"