{"abstract":"Most companies' data-utilization journey begins with customer data.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-282909"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"are you ready to climb aboard the data train","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://cmr.berkeley.edu/2021/04/are-you-ready-to-climb-aboard-the-data-train/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-282909","ids":["cbs-4ef84720-0aa2-48cc-8e28-127ade2565c4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A4B3FEC73D2F831C473C27342233FF54"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://cmr.berkeley.edu/2021/04/are-you-ready-to-climb-aboard-the-data-train/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Marketing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["cbs-4ef84720-0aa2-48cc-8e28-127ade2565c4"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Are You Ready to Climb Aboard the Data Train?","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-282909","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Informal and personal relationships are often seen as the principal competitive advantage of small enterprises. How do big data impact on small business ability to maintain their competitive performance? Big data’s impact on small business practices depends on the interaction patterns between buyers and sellers - moves and countermoves as they unfold in a continuous and interactive market process. The contribution investigates how big data potentially create possibilities for small business for a data-supported market relationship presence. It discusses big data as a resource and match the problematics, tasks, and concerns of small business owners with the potential services rendered by big data, building on small business and entrepreneurship literature.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Andersen, Poul Houman"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-692701"],"filters":{"added":"2023-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Andersen, Poul Houman"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how do big data impact business market relationships","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85130661350&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-692701","identifier":[{"id":"85130661350","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-66c61e2c-0454-420e-8e8f-68bb64cc3417"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-3-01CCA478E8623ED9BF0B2E1BFF4E7A6F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, Cluster for Research on Innovation and Development","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, DVIP","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, IMPact Analyses of investments in Knowledge and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, Marketing and Market Processes Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, Staff Unit 3","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Aalborg University Business School, The IKE Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Poul Houman","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"49d967a4-f257-41f4-b6dd-1b20c5df3923","name":"Andersen, Poul Houman","orcid":"0000-0001-6513-3080","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpedh","last":"Lund Pedersen","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Adam","key":"lindgreenpedh","last":"Lindgreen","name":"Lindgreen, Adam","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpedh","last":"Ritter","name":"Ritter, Thomas","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Torsten","key":"ringbergpedh","last":"Ringberg","name":"Ringberg, Torsten","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4337/9781839100161.00020","eisbn":["9781839100161"],"isbn":["9781839100154"],"pages":"173-190","publisher":"Edward Elgar Publishing","status":"p","subtitle":"Data-Driven Growth in Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises","title":"Big Data in Small Business"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85130661350"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-66c61e2c-0454-420e-8e8f-68bb64cc3417"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"How do big data impact business market relationships?","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-692701","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This important book considers the ways in which small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) can thrive in the age of big data. To address this central issue from multiple viewpoints, the editors introduce a collection of experiences, insights, and guidelines from a variety of expert researchers, each of whom provides a piece to solve this puzzle. Contributions address the limitations faced by SMEs in their access to data and demonstrate that the key to overcoming this issue is to be aware of these limitations, to work within them, and to use them to think creatively about how to overcome obstacles in new ways. They discuss Artificial Intelligence, revenue blueprinting, GDPR compliance and other key topics related to the relationships between SMEs and data. Offering ideas to inspire big data–driven success by SMEs making smaller investments, the book argues that there must be a place for “ordinary” data-driven journeys that are available to firms of any size. Stimulating further thought and action, Big Data in Small Business will be of great interest to academics, researchers and practitioners in areas such as strategic management, organizational and innovation studies, marketing and sales. The ideas and information in this book will help fill knowledge gaps related to important aspects of capabilities, functions, and transformations of big data that drive business growth.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Lindgreen, Adam","Ritter, Thomas","Ringberg, Torsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-280692"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa"],"country":["South Africa"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Pretoria"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"big data in small business data driven growth in small and medium sized enterprises","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-280692","identifier":[{"id":"85130661400","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-37bbe8a6-2bf2-4b89-99c8-cd762556308d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-27108A06DD23729D0E84CEDAF61AE531"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Marketing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"za","key":"university of pretoria","loc":["South Africa","Africa"],"name":"University of Pretoria","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenped","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Adam","key":"lindgreenped","last":"Lindgreen","locid":"22b4423a-774d-4c95-87ff-d5cbdfb33222","name":"Lindgreen, Adam","orcid":"0000-0001-7881-7350","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterped","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torsten","key":"ringbergped","last":"Ringberg","locid":"adf58ccb-b071-474d-b222-fd4c12ee581f","name":"Ringberg, Torsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9079-9682","rank":4,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4337/9781839100161","eisbn":["9781839100161"],"isbn":["9781839100154"],"pa