{"abstract":"The aim of this article is to distil the 99 articles and 173 recitals of the EU General Data Protection Regulation into six overarching principles - of more or less equal importance - that are easy to understand and integrate into the operation of small business.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Trzaskowski, Jan"],"cuid":["S02-088.64-822473"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Trzaskowski, Jan"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gdpr compliant processing of big data in small business","src":["aau","cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85130669456&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-088.64-822473","identifier":[{"id":"85130669456","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d640412a-832f-448b-84c6-2bc9ff630c0a","cbs-d4e7d201-aea3-4be7-b6f4-0ce2dcb813b2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-31741C1CB934F06B674C8849426187BC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Business Humanities and Law, CBS LAW","Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Politics and Philosophy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Civilretsgruppen","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Forskningsgruppen - Offentligret","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Forskningsgruppen - Privatret","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, MASSHINE","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, SSH Children and Youth Research Network","Aalborg University, [Mission] Improved Wellbeing Among Children And Youth In Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"trzaskowskipau","last":"Trzaskowski","locid":"55014d1d-a577-4d2e-a9dd-1333a25d5819","name":"Trzaskowski, Jan","orcid":"0000-0002-4496-3824","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpedh","last":"Lund Pedersen","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Adam","key":"lindgreenpedh","last":"Lindgreen","name":"Lindgreen, Adam","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpedh","last":"Ritter","name":"Ritter, Thomas","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Torsten","key":"ringbergpedh","last":"Ringberg","name":"Ringberg, Torsten","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4337/9781839100161.00010","eisbn":["9781839100161"],"isbn":["9781839100154"],"pages":"27-39","place":"Cheltenham","publisher":"Edward Elgar Publishing","status":"p","subtitle":"Data-driven Growth in Small and Medium-sized Enterprises","title":"Big Data in Small Business"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85130669456"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d640412a-832f-448b-84c6-2bc9ff630c0a","cbs-d4e7d201-aea3-4be7-b6f4-0ce2dcb813b2"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"GDPR Compliant Processing of Big Data in Small Business","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-088.64-822473","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Illustrated by the current Covid-19 crisis, business relationships can serverely be impacted by forces that are outside the control of either sides of the relationship. Given this uncertainty, or sudden strategic surprises, and the need for managers involved in a business relationship to handle such situations successfully, we propose the novel concept of mutual uncertainty preparedness, which conceptualizes the degree to which partners create crisis readiness in the relationship to act when a crisis eventually materializes. Based on different streams of literature, we suggest fitness and motivation as conceptual dimensions of mutual uncertainty preparedness. We also develop a theoretical framework to discuss the consequences of mutual uncertainty preparedness. This initial discussion of mutual uncertainty preparedness points towards a research agenda on preparedness in business markets.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Kleinaltenkamp, Michael","Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-276861"],"event":{"end":"2021-05-28","place":"Madrid, es","start":"2021-05-25","title":"The 50th EMAC Annual Conference 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Freie Universität Berlin"],"keyword":["Mutuality","Preparedness","Uncertainty"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mutual uncertainty preparedness in business relationships","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://proceedings.emac-online.org/pdfs/A2021-94483.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-276861","ids