{"author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-286206"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"edu","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"four types of competition that can threaten your company","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-286206","ids":["cbs-710a74c8-2ff5-47ed-a053-e0ffc352c996"],"lang":"English","level":"Educational","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7CB64185A7342A07A88D1C74017FE990"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Marketing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9781633698932"],"isbn":["9781633698925"],"pages":"105-114","place":"Boston","publisher":"Harvard Business School Press","series":"Harvard Business Review Guides","status":"p","title":"HBR Guide to Setting Your Strategy"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-710a74c8-2ff5-47ed-a053-e0ffc352c996"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Four Types of Competition that can Threaten Your Company","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-286206","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"In the light of the current coronavirus crisis, business-to-business firms face a variety of challenges in a complex and fast-changing environment. In order to provide structured analysis and to guide strategic decision-making, we present a novel, five-step approach for analyzing the impact of a crisis on a firm's business model. We applied the approach with eight business-to-business firms and find support for its usefulness. The evidence suggests very different impacts of the coronavirus crisis on business-to-business firms, and that understanding these differences is important for strategizing during the crisis but also to navigating successfully into the future. We also describe six different types of crisis impacts on business models. We conclude by developing managerial implications and questions for future research.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-294370"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Ritter, Thomas"],"keyword":["Business model","Capability","Crisis","Customer","Impact type","Value proposition"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"analyzing the impact of the coronavirus crisis on business models","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indmarman.2020.05.014","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-294370","identifier":[{"id":"85085585164","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-c77df235-932e-40d2-b8a6-dd707b2da0d6"],"keyword":["Business model","Capability","Crisis","Customer","Impact type","Value proposition"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-83F7C14A2010FD4DCC89FABA42D784E7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indmarman.2020.05.014","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten Lund","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","name_org":"Pedersen, Carsten Lund","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.indmarman.2020.05.014","issn":["00198501","18732062"],"issn_org":["00198501"],"journal":"Industrial Marketing Management","pages":"214-224","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Industrial Marketing Management","volume":"88"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85085585164"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-c77df235-932e-40d2-b8a6-dd707b2da0d6"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Analyzing the Impact of the Coronavirus Crisis on Business Models","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-294370","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Den aktuelle krise kommer til at påvirke de fleste forretningsmodeller i erhvervslivet, også efter at krisen er overstået. Gennemgang af hovedpointer i analysen, som er publiceret i en arbejdsbog, som afdækker seks forskellige påvirkningsmønstre virksomheder typisk vil falde i, helt eller delvist.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-298570"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"coronavirus smitter også af på forretningsmodeller","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://ugebrev.dk/ledelse/coronavirus-smitter-ogsaa-af-paa-forretningsmodeller/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-298570","ids":["cbs-f2ce34b7-dff3-4b66-91a4-07f9ee35a4b0"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B462BC2FA5AB0FD326F9FF37A843E6CC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://ugebrev.dk/ledelse/coronavirus-smitter-ogsaa-af-paa-forretningsmodeller/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"journal":"Økonomisk Ugebrev - Ledelse","pages":"18","publisher":"Økonomisk Ugebrev","status":"p","title":"Økonomisk Ugebrev - Ledelse"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-f2ce34b7-dff3-4b66-91a4-07f9ee35a4b0"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Coronavirus smitter også af på forretningsmodeller","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-298570","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"As shown in Jaderberg et al. (2019), multiagent reinforcement learning is a promising avenue for artificial intelligence research, as agents have been documented to collaborate at human-level performance in the three-dimensional multiplayer game Quake III Arena in Capture the Flag mode. While it is impressive that multiagent collaboration at human-level performance is now possible, it also raises the inevitable question if we, as human-beings, have the skill and will to collaborate with AI agents in the future? As the findings arguably allude to, a failure to do so could erode our historical competitive advantage of collaboration in the race against the machines. Consequently, we need to find our appropriate coopetition strategy, i.e. The optimal combination of collaboration and competition, if we are to co-exist with AI agents in the future. Or to paraphrase the famous Danish scientist and artist Piet Hein: It is a question of “co-existence or no existence”.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-276921"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"re human level performance in 000000000003d multiplayer games with population based reinforcement learning","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://science.sciencemag.org/content/364/6443/859/tab-e-letters","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-276921","ids":["cbs-1089d7fd-cd86-47d2-9d46-07ac039a6fb6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DC4B60F812D0416494F79AE352F31410"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00368075","10959203"],"issn_org":["00368075"],"journal":"Science","publisher":"American Association for the Advancement of Science","status":"p","title":"Science"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-1089d7fd-cd86-47d2-9d46-07ac039a6fb6"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"RE: Human-level Performance in 3D Multiplayer Games with Population-based Reinforcement Learning","type":"Journal Comment","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-276921","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"As uncertainty is increasing and competition is becoming more fierce, executives need to have a broader understanding of competition itself in order to sustain an edge. Executives should be thinking about four different types of competition to maintain relevance in a changing environment. This 2×2 provides an overview of the four types of competition and the four key questions that help identify important strategic issues.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-283309"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the 000000000004 types of competition 000000000002x000000000002 matrix for hbr s visual library","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"do","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-283309","ids":["cbs-53508492-da62-405c-81f9-33f1a78e3e6c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5B302A4F3FCC81B422DC2B38567AE7CF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f5