{"abstract":"Strategies, when executed to a perfect blend, can even end a World War. This is why organisations and corporations put considerable value on effective strategic planning whether it be conforming, deviant, or a mixture of both. In this article, the authors emphasise the essence of managing and synchronising two types of strategists in a company.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-298142"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"your strategy needs 000000000002 types of people","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.europeanbusinessreview.com/your-strategy-needs-2-types-of-people/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-298142","ids":["cbs-eeb2ab4a-1a73-4a28-ae87-f68bb16d8fe4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-640D0164DFE79952F1334983815BC7FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.europeanbusinessreview.com/your-strategy-needs-2-types-of-people/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78