{"abstract":"Hver person har sin egen måde at organisere et givent projekt på. Her kan du læse om fire typer af projektledere, som de fleste møder – og om hvorfor en mangfoldighed i typer er godt i enhver organisation.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-281301"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"test dig selv hvilken type projektleder er du","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://videnskab.dk/kultur-samfund/test-dig-selv-hvilken-type-projektleder-er-du","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-281301","ids":["cbs-3e2d7c96-653c-4b87-b00a-8e5233ed6c11"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-69E598A70889A46898A84009D03EBA3C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://videnskab.dk/kultur-samfund/test-dig-selv-hvilken-type-projektleder-er-du","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization","Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode"