ew Taiwan"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-cee2ff5f-be05-452e-8157-553522b0be06"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"策略壓力適當，企業績效妥當","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-295080","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Purpose: As a great deal of strategy execution takes the form of strategic projects, how you align these projects ultimately determines the success or failure of your strategy. Here, we discuss four executive challenges executives need to tackle to successfully manage a strategy in a project-based world. Design/methodology/approach: Conceptual approach entailing illustrative case-examples Findings: We find four executive challenges to tackle in order to successfully manage a strategy in a project-based world. Research limitations/implications: As the study draws upon conceptual arguments, future studies need to assess the verisimilitude and boundary conditions of the challenges. Practical implications: By thinking of a strategy through a project-based lens, and understanding the challenges thereof, executives should be better able to bridge strategy formulation and execution. Social implications: A project-based approach to strategy is not necessarily limited to a for-profit sector; NGOs and governmental organizations may similarly learn from and draw upon a project-based approach to strategy. Originality/value: As little research within strategy has explicitly conveyed a project-based lens, the study emphasizes a novel approach to strategy.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-296066"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the four executive challenges of project based strategy","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-296066","identifier":[{"id":"85055872437","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-d96e6fde-3b06-489a-8c37-ac2a5c221117"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-53D6B52E127736A23AB3F4E855654B60"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization","Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1108/sl-09-2018-0089","issn":["10878572","17589568"],"issn_org":["10878572"],"issue":"6","journal":"Strategy & Leadership","pages":"44-49","publisher":"Emerald Group Publishing","status":"p","title":"Strategy & Leadership","volume":"46"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85055872437"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-d96e6fde-3b06-489a-8c37-ac2a5c221117"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"The Four Executive Challenges of Project-based Strategy","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-296066","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Everyone has their own way of organising a project. Read about the four types of leadership, and why a variety of types is good for any organisation. Take the quiz: What type of project leader are you?","author_count":2,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Ritter, Thomas"],"cuid":["S02-092.31-032061"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what type of project leader are you","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://sciencenordic.com/what-type-project-leader-are-you","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-092.31-032061","ids":["cbs-ccdc9b9a-6a8a-4145-8a2f-cae3560c00df","cbs-f25f9112-8d66-48b8-bd8d-55308b8da3f1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-D3B0FA4E121124DE3E81B911D4CB2321"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://cbswire.dk/what-type-of-project-leader-are-you/","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://sciencenordic.com/what-type-project-leader-are-you","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization","Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategy and Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding"