{"abstract":"En klodset forretningsidé kan forvandle sig fra en grim ælling til en smuk svane - derfor skal ledere være åbne for nye idéer","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-281152"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lad forretningsidéer vokse sig smukke","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://borsen.dk/nyheder/opinion/artikel/11/174139/artikel.html","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-281152","ids":["cbs-3c9c3e2b-e0e7-495c-90fc-0304bbabb8bf"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FBD6DB0B75B262D1B238EF4B2AF3B5FB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01050729","09068317"],"issn_org":["01050729"],"newspaper":"Børsen","pages":"4-5","publisher":"Dagbladet Boersen AS","publisher_org":"Dagbladet Boersen A/S","status":"p","title":"Børsen"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-3c9c3e2b-e0e7-495c-90fc-0304bbabb8bf"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Lad forretningsidéer vokse sig smukke","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-281152","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Den tilbagevendende sag om Trumps dekret vedrørende indrejseforbud har givet os et indblik i dette klassiske ledelsesdilemma, der trækker tråde tilbage til eventyret om Kejserens nye Klæder. H. C. Andersens berømte fortælling om Kejserens nye klæder indeholder tre vigtige ledelsesmæssige pointer, der netop har bevist dets relevans i sagen om Trumps indrejseforbud. Ligesom kejseren i fortællingen, så udviser Trump generelt en alternativ virkelighedsopfattelse.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-282578"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"er trump som kejseren i kejserens nye klæder","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-282578","ids":["cbs-4b9c261b-e7eb-4f45-a3c3-20efdc11a98f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B928C9AE958F319EF79F653B51A27442"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01050729","09068317"],"issn_org":["01050729"],"newspaper":"Børsen","pages":"4","publisher":"Dagbladet Boersen AS","publisher_org":"Dagbladet Boersen A/S","status":"p","title":"Børsen"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-4b9c261b-e7eb-4f45-a3c3-20efdc11a98f"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Er Trump som kejseren i \"Kejserens nye klæder\"?","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-282578","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Many business leaders have great expectations of the monetization of data. However, reality shows that the path to data-driven profits is neither easy nor straightforward. Therefore, many expectations go unrealized. Over the past two years, we have studied the capabilities that are necessary for realizing data-driven profits. In other words, we have investigated the capabilities firms need in order to transform Big Data into Big Business. Our work concluded with the development of a capability map – a fairly substantial map detailing nine capabilities that organizations must master in order to release the full potential of data-driven opportunities. This guide is a practitioner-oriented presentation of the nine capabilities found in the capability map, which is entitled DataProfit. We describe each capability and invite you to analyze your organization as we go along. On the final pages, we bring the pieces together and create an overview of your organization’s capabilities. Based on that overview, you can develop your own path to data-driven growth. We hope you enjoy working with DataProfit!","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Eibe Sørensen, Hans"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-275672"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dataprofit a capability map for data driven growth","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/58445576/ritter_pedersen_s_rensen_dataprofit_june2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-275672","ids":["cbs-029943d2-9899-473e-b8ae-d0db07b63294"],"lang":"English","lev