b-4c77-4f60-bf58-7402eb177991"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"A Project-based Lens for Customer Relationship Strategy","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-279529","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Mange erhvervsledere har store forventninger til at bruge data til at tjene penge i deres virksomheder. Dog viser det sig, at det ikke er så ligetil – mange forventninger bliver simpelthen ikke indfriet. Derfor har vi igennem de seneste to år kortlagt de kompetencer, som er nødvendige for at realisere datadreven vækst i virksomheder. Eller sagt på en anden måde: hvilke kompetencer muliggør, at virksomhederne omdanner Big Data til Big Business. Vores analyser er mundet ud i en kompetencekortlægning til datadreven vækst. Kompetencekortlægningen er omfattende – hele ni kompetencer skal spille sammen for at udnytte mulighederne for datadreven profitabel vækst. Denne guide giver en anvendelsesorienteret gennemgang af de ni kompetencer i vores kort, som vi kalder for DataProfit. I guiden beskrives hver kompetence – og du inviteres til at analysere din virksomhed. Til sidst sætter vi hele kompetencekortet sammen, så du får et godt overblik over din virksomheds kompetenceniveau. Og derefter kan du bruge kortlægningen til at udstikke de retninger, udviklingen af datadreven vækst skal gå i din virksomhed.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ritter, Thomas","Lund Pedersen, Carsten","Eibe Sørensen, Hans"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-282105"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dataprofit kompetencekort for datadreven vækst","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/58445273/ritter_pedersen_s_rensen_dataprofit_april2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-282105","ids":["cbs-46cbad82-5407-4646-9de0-cc1cd9e10a86"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6D74F7B5D8342E0B7A2AF56EFC424604"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/58445273/ritter_pedersen_s_rensen_dataprofit_april2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"ritterpau","last":"Ritter","locid":"69cce423-3a9c-428c-9f55-37e31f887596","name":"Ritter, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0003-4526-1573","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans","key":"eibesørensenpau","last":"Eibe Sørensen","locid":"c3bf1689-3380-4705-b71e-51d1eb6f435c","name":"Eibe Sørensen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0002-9430-6777","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"27","place":"København","publisher":"The CBS Competitiveness Platform","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-46cbad82-5407-4646-9de0-cc1cd9e10a86"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"DataProfit : Kompetencekort for datadreven vækst","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-282105","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Idea in Brief: Problem: There is an enormous profit potential for manufacturing firms in big data, but one of the key barriers to obtaining data-driven growth is the lack of knowledge about which capabilities are needed to extract value and profit from data. Solution: We (BDBB research group at CBS) have developed a research-based capability mapping tool, entitled DataProfit, which the public business consultants can use to upgrade their tool kit to enable data-driven growth in manufacturing organizations. Benefit: The DataProfit model/tool comprises insights of an extensive research project that has been developed and tested in a multitude of manufacturing organizations – thus making it both a proven solution and a new idea. Moreover, resources for the application of the model are freely available online.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Lund Pedersen, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-286809"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"from big data to big business using the research based dataprofit model for data driven growth","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://challenges.citizenlab.co/posts/Rp3rBej7yamtYDGWN/from-big-data-to-big-business-using-the-research-based-and","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-286809","ids":["cbs-777bc7a4-5eb9-4825-95ee-544b77c30eb9"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2BE1892580B0048830B162ED5D9D902F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://challenges.citizenlab.co/posts/Rp3rBej7yamtYDGWN/from-big-data-to-big-business-using-the-research-based-and","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Strategic Management and Globalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"lundpedersenpau","last":"Lund Pedersen","locid":"c8c78428-7e36-4374-8028-23e1f4eac4d3","name":"Lund Pedersen, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-9328-9784","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["cbs-777bc7a4-5eb9-4825-95ee-544b77c30eb9"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"From Big Data to Big Business : Using the Research-based DataProfit Model for Data-driven Growth","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-286809","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
